tests/golden/check/catalogue-a-language-version-line-is-refused.case/main.hero:6:5: error[catalogue_refused]: `use <json>/parse` reaches a package through the catalogue, and it does not read: tests/golden/check/catalogue-a-language-version-line-is-refused.case/heroes.toml:1: `edition` is no line of a catalogue: above its entries it holds the `index` line alone, and each entry is a table `[dependencies.<name>]`; a catalogue holds the dependencies of the program or the package at whose root it stands and, above them, the one `index` line naming where they are read from, and nothing else — a catalogue that does not read names no package, the lines above that one included
